Text: Fol- lowing we describe the dataset. In Table 1 we summarizes its statistics. Table 1: Description of the dataset. Russian Trolls Regular Accounts Total # of Accounts Total # of Tweets 1,840,679 3.1 Russian Trolls (IRA) We used the IRA dataset8 that was released by Twitter after identifying the Russian trolls. The original dataset contains 3, 841 accounts, but we use a lower number of accounts and tweets after ﬁltering them. We focus on accounts that use English as main language.

Rank: 4
