Section: None
Text: Thus, we propose the following features to identify these users using only their tweets text: – Native Language Identiﬁcation (NLI): This feature was inspired by earlier works on identifying native language of essays writers [22]. We aim to detect IRA trolls by identifying their way of writing English tweets. As shown in [31], English tweets generated by non-English speakers have a diﬀerent syntactic pattern .

