Text: With this representation we aim at capturing the ”Flip-Flop” behavior of IRA trolls among the themes (see Section 5.4). 4.2 Proﬁling IRA Accounts As Twitter declared, although the IRA campaign was originated in Russia, it has been found that IRA trolls concealed their identity by tweeting in English. Furthermore, for any possibility of unmasking their identity, the majority of IRA trolls changed their location to other countries and the language of the Twitter interface they use.

